// RepoFilesPanel.jsx
// Repository detail explorer: file/folder tree on the left, a searchable /
// filterable / paginated issue list on the right, and a full vulnerable-vs-fixed
// code detail card below — matching the SecureCode reference design.
//
// Per-file, per-line finding detail isn't served by the API yet, so this view
// builds a realistic, deterministic mock breakdown from the project's own
// (real) severity totals — every number on the stat cards ties back to the
// same `project` object the rest of the dashboard already uses. Only the
// file tree and line-level finding detail are generated client-side.

